          "speakerId": "PERFORMER.NARRATOR",
          "speakerName": "Epic Narrator",
          "voiceProfileRef": "VOICE.NARRATOR",
          "text": "The gods take their places in a widening ring. Poseidon’s seat remains empty.",
          "sourceTurnId": "OD-B01-S01-T01",
          "pauseAfterMs": 300
        }
      },
      {
        "gi": 2,
        "start": 23.8,
        "dur": 2.6,
        "script": {
          "kind": "SPEAKER_CUE",
          "speakerId": "PERFORMER.NARRATOR",
          "speakerName": "Epic Narrator",
          "voiceProfileRef": "VOICE.NARRATOR",
          "text": "Zeus",
          "sourceTurnId": "OD-B01-S01-T02",
          "pauseAfterMs": 120
        }
      },
      {
        "gi": 3,
        "start": 26.52,
        "dur": 27.12,
        "script": {
          "kind": "DIALOGUE",
          "speakerId": "character.zeus",
          "speakerName": "Zeus",
          "voiceProfileRef": "VOICE.ZEUS",
          "text": "Mortals are quick to blame the gods, yet they heap fresh grief upon the portion fate has given them. Aegisthus was warned; he chose the act and paid its price.",
          "sourceTurnId": "OD-B01-S01-T02",
          "pauseAfterMs": 360
        }
      },
      {
        "gi": 4,
        "start": 54,
        "dur": 1.32,
        "script": {
          "kind": "SPEAKER_CUE",
          "speakerId": "PERFORMER.NARRATOR",
          "speakerName": "Epic Narrator",
          "voiceProfileRef": "VOICE.NARRATOR",
          "text": "Athena",
          "sourceTurnId": "OD-B01-S01-T03",
          "pauseAfterMs": 120
        }
      },
      {
        "gi": 5,
        "start": 55.44,
        "dur": 27.44,
        "script": {
          "kind": "DIALOGUE",
          "speakerId": "character.athena",
          "speakerName": "Athena",
          "voiceProfileRef": "VOICE.ATHENA",
          "text": "Then turn your eyes from the man who earned his death to the man who still endures. Odysseus wastes on Calypso’s island, longing for the smoke of home.",
          "sourceTurnId": "OD-B01-S01-T03",
          "pauseAfterMs": 360
        }
      },
      {
        "gi": 6,
        "start": 83.24,
        "dur": 29.96,
        "script": {
          "kind": "DIALOGUE",
          "speakerId": "character.zeus",
          "speakerName": "Zeus",
          "voiceProfileRef": "VOICE.ZEUS",
          "text": "Poseidon’s anger bars the road, but one god cannot stand forever against the purpose of us all. Set the return in motion.",
          "sourceTurnId": "OD-B01-S01-T04",
          "pauseAfterMs": 360
        }
      }
